// reference each other (a quest line needs a creature and an item) and can be edited, built, flown and exported alone.
// DISTINCT from Mod Packs (lib/cyrus/modpack: several separate mods installed together through the conflict engine).
// Pure + client-safe (no node APIs; fingerprints are FNV-1a, a change detector, not a security hash). Flag
// CYRUS_MOD_SUITES (off): v1 stays the engine default; the store accepts v2 only while the flag is on.
